# Decode
# - ESR 0x96000035: EC=0x25 (data abort, current EL), DFSC=0x35 (synchronous
#   EXTERNAL abort on translation table walk).
# - ELR/LR in wait_until_or_timeout path (timer sleep); FAR is linear-map DRAM.
# - x13 == ffff8000026ba168 matches the previous F2 dump exactly (same object).
# - DAIF unmasked. Board halted. Distinct from the slab wild-pointer fault (F1),
#   which is fixed: the entire stress workload completed cleanly first.
